#: ../../api/connecting.md:1 2886d5064bd4413cae394d0cd0025f06
msgid "Connecting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/connecting.md:3 59eaed473df045d488cc25c032cfc638
msgid ""
"The service speaks Protobuf over a WebSocket. One binary message carries "
"exactly one serialized frame — WebSocket already delimits messages, so "
"there is no length prefix of your own to write."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/connecting.md:11 735842f0d8a141c88e6144c1db25e8fd
msgid ""
"`--host` and `--port` move it, with one refusal: a routable `--host` and "
"no token is refused at startup rather than served."
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/connecting.md:14 925e335245e94b4c88edf462bb9358b9
msgid "The handshake"
msgstr ""

#: ../../api/connecting.md:16 4e74a132b77e4fe09182cc091a0bd2d3
msgid ""
"Offer the subprotocol **`qlservice.v2`**. The service answers with "
"exactly one protocol and never echoes a token back, because a browser "
"fails a handshake in which it named protocols and the server selected "
"none."
msgstr ""

